---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import MenuBar from "./MenuBar.astro";

interface Props {
  links: { label: string; href: string }[];
}
const { links } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="ie" data-internet>
  <div class="ie-bar">
    <button type="button" data-ie-back disabled>◀ Back</button>
    <button type="button" data-ie-home>⌂ Home</button>
    <label>Address <input readonly data-ie-address value="kk://dialup" /></label>
  </div>
  <div class="ie-page">
    <div class="ie-dial" data-ie-screen="dial">
      <p><b>KK Dial-Up Networking</b></p>
      <ol data-ie-log aria-live="polite"></ol>
      <button type="button" data-ie-skip>Skip</button>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="ie-surf" data-ie-screen="surf" hidden aria-label="Surf with me: open my favorite links">
      <picture>
        <source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)" srcset="surf/still.png" />
        <source srcset="surf/loop.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img src="surf/loop.gif" width="576" height="384" alt="Pixel-art Kristóf surfing in front of a big wave, saying: Surfing the internet? Surf with me!" />
      </picture>
    </button>
    <img class="ie-away" data-ie-screen="away" hidden alt="Kristóf surfs away as the wave breaks" width="576" height="384" />
    <div class="ie-favs" data-ie-screen="favs" hidden>
      <h2>★ Favorites</h2>
      <ul>
        {links.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">🌐 {l.label}</a></li>)}
        <li><button type="button" class="link-button" data-open="side-projects">💾 My side projects</button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="link-button" data-ie-zone>🎮 KK Game Zone: play against people from 2003</button></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">Best viewed in KK Explorer at 800×600.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ie-zone" data-ie-screen="zone" hidden>
      <div class="zone-home" data-zone-home>
        <h2>🎮 KK Game Zone</h2>
        <p>The five Internet games from Windows XP, with opponents found for you "worldwide". They're friendly bots from 2003: nothing about you leaves this page.</p>
        <ul class="zone-games">
          <li><button type="button" data-zone-game="reversi"><Icon name="reversi" size={32} /><span><b>Internet Reversi</b>Jenkins against GitLab CI</span></button></li>
          <li><button type="button" data-zone-game="checkers"><Icon name="checkers" size={32} /><span><b>Internet Checkers</b>Debrecen against Budapest</span></button></li>
          <li><button type="button" disabled><Icon name="reversi" size={32} /><span><b>Internet Backgammon</b>Coming soon</span></button></li>
          <li><button type="button" disabled><Icon name="reversi" size={32} /><span><b>Internet Hearts</b>Coming soon</span></button></li>
          <li><button type="button" disabled><Icon name="reversi" size={32} /><span><b>Internet Spades</b>Coming soon</span></button></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="zone-room" data-zone-room hidden>
        <MenuBar
          label="Game Zone"
          menus={[
            {
              title: "Game",
              items: [
                { id: "find", label: "Find New Opponent" },
                "-",
                { id: "skill0", label: "Beginner", group: "skill" },
                { id: "skill1", label: "Intermediate", group: "skill" },
                { id: "skill2", label: "Expert", group: "skill" },
                "-",
                { id: "chatstart", label: "Turn Chat On at Startup", check: true, on: true },
                "-",
                { id: "leave", label: "Exit" },
              ],
            },
            {
              title: "Help",
              items: [
                { id: "help", label: "How to play", key: "F1" },
                { id: "web", label: "On the Web" },
                "-",
                { id: "about", label: "About the Game Zone" },
              ],
            },
          ]}
        />
        <ol class="zone-connect" data-zone-connect aria-live="polite"></ol>
        <div class="zone-play" data-zone-play hidden>
          <div class="zone-board" data-zone-board></div>
          <aside class="zone-side">
            <ul class="zone-players" data-zone-players aria-label="Players"></ul>
            <ul class="zone-chat" data-zone-chat aria-label="Chat" aria-live="polite"></ul>
            <select data-zone-say aria-label="Chat message"></select>
            <div class="zone-chaton" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Chat">
              <label><input type="radio" name="zone-chat" value="on" checked /> Chat on</label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="zone-chat" value="off" /> Off</label>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="status-bar"><p class="status-bar-field" data-ie-status>Dialing…</p></div>

  <dialog class="xp-dialog" data-ask aria-labelledby="ie-ask-t">
    <div class="xp-dtitle" id="ie-ask-t" data-ask-title>Game Zone</div>
    <form method="dialog" class="xp-dialog-body">
      <p data-ask-text></p>
      <div class="xp-dialog-buttons" data-ask-buttons></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="xp-dialog" data-zone-notice aria-labelledby="ie-notice-t">
    <div class="xp-dtitle" id="ie-notice-t">KK Game Zone</div>
    <form method="dialog" class="xp-dialog-body">
      <p>Welcome to the KK Game Zone. You'll be matched with players from around the world, at the skill level you choose.</p>
      <p>Honest version: the players are bots from 2003 and nothing leaves this page. No names, no data, no servers.</p>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="again" checked /> Show this every time</label>
      <div class="xp-dialog-buttons"><button value="play">Play</button><button value="quit">Quit</button><button value="help">Help</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="xp-dialog" data-zone-illegal aria-labelledby="ie-ill-t">
    <div class="xp-dtitle" id="ie-ill-t">Internet Reversi</div>
    <form method="dialog" class="xp-dialog-body">
      <p>That square isn't a legal move. A move must trap at least one of your opponent's stones in a straight line (across, down or diagonally) between the new stone and one of yours.</p>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="tell" checked /> Tell me this every time</label>
      <div class="xp-dialog-buttons"><button value="ok">OK</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="xp-dialog" data-zone-help aria-labelledby="ie-zhelp-t">
    <div class="xp-dtitle" id="ie-zhelp-t" data-zone-help-title>How to play</div>
    <form method="dialog" class="xp-dialog-body sw-help">
      <div data-zone-help-text></div>
      <div class="xp-dialog-buttons"><button value="ok">OK</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
</div>
<script>
  import { initInternet } from "../scripts/internet-ui";
  for (const el of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-internet]")) initInternet(el);
</script>
